  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ずつうになるほどの　サイコパワーを\nしゅういに　はなって　ほかの\nせいぶつを　とおざけているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "두통이 생길 정도의 사이코 파워를\n주위에 발산해서 다른 생물이\n접근하지 못하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由於會朝四周釋放足以\n引起頭痛的精神力量，\n其他生物都躲得遠遠的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il éloigne les autres êtres vivants en émettant\ndes ondes psychiques pouvant donner\ndes maux de tête épouvantables.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die starken Psycho-Kräfte, die es ausstrahlt,\nrufen Kopfschmerzen hervor. So hält es andere\nLebewesen von sich fern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mantener alejados a los demás seres vivos,\nemana a su alrededor ondas psíquicas cuya\npotencia es capaz de provocar jaquecas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene alla larga gli esseri viventi che si trovano\nnei paraggi emettendo onde psichiche così forti\nda far venire il mal di testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It emits psychic power strong enough to cause\nheadaches as a deterrent to the approach\nof others.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭痛になるほどの　サイコパワーを\n周囲に　放って　ほかの\n生物を　遠ざけているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由于会朝四周释放足以\n引起头痛的精神力量，\n其他生物都躲得远远的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mantener alejados a los demás seres vivos,\nemana a su alrededor ondas psíquicas cuya\npotencia es capaz de provocar jaquecas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "べつめいは　もりの　まじょ。\nさわぎたてると　しょくしゅのツメで\nひきさかれるかも　しれないぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "숲의 마녀라는 별명을 가졌다.\n소란을 피우면 촉수의 손톱에\n찢겨질지도 모른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "又被稱為森林魔女。\n如果有人大吵大鬧，可能會\n被牠用觸手上的爪子撕碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On l’appelle aussi la « sorcière de la forêt ».\nCe Pokémon lacère quiconque fait trop de bruit\navec les griffes de son tentacule.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wird auch „Hexe des Waldes“ genannt. Wer\nLärm veranstaltet, wird unter Umständen von der\nKlaue an seinem Fühler auseinandergenommen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recibe el apodo de Hechicera del Bosque.\nQuienes arman demasiado barullo se exponen a\nser despedazados por las garras de su tentáculo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È conosciuto anche come “maga del bosco”.\nSe qualcuno fa troppo chiasso rischia di essere\nfatto a pezzettini dagli artigli sul suo tentacolo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If you’re too loud around it, you risk being torn\napart by the claws on its tentacle. This Pokémon\nis also known as the Forest Witch.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "別名は　森の　魔女。\n騒ぎたてると　触手のツメで\n引き裂かれるかも　しれないぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "又被称为森林魔女。\n如果有人大吵大闹，可能会\n被它用触手上的爪子撕碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recibe el apodo de Hechicera del Bosque.\nQuienes arman demasiado barullo se exponen a\nser despedazados por las garras de su tentáculo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すみかの　もりに　たちいるものをビームで　きぜつさせ　サイコパワーできょうかした　ツメで　きりさく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거처로 삼은 숲에 들어오는 자를 빔으로 기절시킨 뒤 사이코 파워로 강화된 손톱으로 찢어발긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只要有誰踏進自己棲息的森林裡，牠就會釋放光束讓對方昏厥，再以精神力量強化爪子後將其撕碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon neutralise tout être qui s’introduit dans sa forêt en tirant un rayon, puis le lacère de ses griffes renforcées par ses pouvoirs psychiques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eindringlingen in seinen Wald raubt es mit einem Strahl das Bewusstsein, ehe es sie mit seiner durch Psycho-Kräfte verstärkten Klaue zerfetzt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Inmoviliza con un rayo y destroza con su garra reforzada con poder psíquico a todo aquel que se adentre en el bosque que habita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Stordisce con un raggio chiunque osi addentrarsi nel bosco in cui vive e lo squarcia con gli artigli, fortificati tramite i suoi poteri psichici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hatterene knocks out those that intrude in its home forest by blasting them with a beam, then slashing with claws enhanced by psychic power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲み処の　森に　立ち入る者をビームで　気絶させ　サイコパワーで強化した　ツメで　切り裂く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "若有谁踏进它所栖息的森林，它就会放出光束让对方晕厥，再用以精神力量强化后的爪子将其撕碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Inmoviliza con un rayo y destroza con su garra reforzada con poder psíquico a todo aquel que se adentre en el bosque que habita.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いきものの　けはいが　しない　もりはようちゅうい。　ブリムオンのなわばりに　はいったかも　しれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "생명체의 기척이 느껴지지 않는 숲은 주의해야 한다. 브리무음의 영역을 침범한 것일 수도 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "要小心沒有任何生物氣息的森林，因為那代表你可能進入了布莉姆溫的地盤。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il faut se méfier des forêts dépourvues de tout signe de vie : il s’agit peut-être des territoires de Sorcilence.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bei Wäldern ohne Anzeichen von Leben sollte man Vorsicht walten lassen. Es ist gut möglich, dass man sich im Revier eines Silembrim befindet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hay que ir con cuidado al adentrarse en un bosque en el que no haya indicio de seres vivos, pues puede tratarse del territorio de Hatterene.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando ci si imbatte in un bosco all’apparenza desolato, meglio fare attenzione: potrebbe trattarsi del territorio di un Hatterene.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Beware of forests that show no signs of living creatures within. You may have wandered into Hatterene’s territory.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生き物の　気配が　しない　森は要注意。　ブリムオンの縄張りに　入ったかも　しれない。",
